<!-- BLUEDESERT_RM_MOD_BUILD_1: moved here unchanged from
     src/RimUtinni/UtinniPatches/Defs/ThingDefs_Plants/RM_BlueDesertFlora.xml.
     Every Class="RimMandrake.BlueDesert...." reference below still resolves —
     namespace and class names are unchanged, only the assembly moved
     (src/RimMandrake/BlueDesert/Source/BlueDesertLife.cs). -->
<!--
  BLUE_DESERT_LIFE_AUTHORING_1 (steps 2-5) — the transparent fractal flora,
  per design/Jawa/worldbuilding/creatures/blue_desert_hydrocarbon_life.md §6.
  Names and slots adopted from RUT_hydrocarbon_ecology_commission.md §6
  (owner-ruled by card 2026-09-10); this file gives them the mechanical spec.
  RM_ tier — see BlueDesertLife.cs's header for why this lives here for now.

  §1a: completelyIgnoreFertility true on all three — Ice is fertility 0
  everywhere in this biome, so without this flag `plantDensity` restoring to
  0.33 changes nothing and the biome stays bare with a number that reads
  healthy (WildPlantSpawner.CheckSpawnWildPlantAt/GetDesiredPlantsCountAt).

  §1b: the whole growth-temperature band sits below the phase line (median
  -42.6C); growMinGlow/growOptimalGlow 0 is the cave-plant idiom
  (Plants_Cave.xml) for "needs no light", NOT cavePlant=true (that only spawns
  under thick roof, wrong for an open plateau). dieIfNoSunlight false overrides
  the (true) default that would otherwise kill an unlit transparent plant.

  §1c: Flammability 0.05 is why "cold enough that starting them burning is
  very hard" (the sheet's own line) is true in play — vanilla fire has no
  concept of cold; this is authored, not free.

  §2f/§6a: every card's ingestible.outcomeDoers gives RM_ButaneGut to any
  ingester that is NOT a Blue Desert native (RM_HydrocarbonNativeExtension) —
  ban 3, "no warm-safe hydrocarbon organic", extends to what eats it too.

  §2b/§2d: CompProperties_PlantCharge (BlueDesertLife.cs) is the fuse — kills
  the plant on 2 consecutive warm Long-ticks, and on a KillFinalize destroy
  (damage, never eating/cutting — §1g) detonates 40 Flame at its own radius.
  Every MaxHitPoints here is <= 40 (§2d) so one blast finishes the next ring.

  6a's `detonateAbove` lives in Mod Settings instead of XML (one global slider,
  UtinniPatchesSettings.warmDetonationThresholdC, default 5C) rather than a
  per-card XML field — the brief's own cards all use the same number anyway,
  and MOD_OPTIONS_RETROFIT_1 wants it player-tunable in one place, not three.

  Art: NONE EXISTS YET (re-checked 2026-09-21: registry.jsonl/done/_artsrc/
  art_status.json all empty for these subjects). texPaths below point at where
  fill_queue.py's queued jobs (art_lists/blue_desert_life.csv) will land —
  until the daemon renders them, these show as missing-texture placeholders in
  game. Shipping the mechanic ahead of the art is this project's standing
  practice, not an oversight. What a render must show: transparency (the ice
  visible THROUGH the body) and fractal branching (§8) — no leaves, no solid
  silhouette.

  mandrake.rut.plantgrowth's x4 fast-growth multiplier is turned off for these
  three via PlantGrowthSettingsDef.exemptPlants (JawaPlantGrowthSettings.xml) —
  growDays below already assume vanilla rate (brief §6a note).
-->
