  <!-- ============== Virr (whistle-reed, mid) — BLUEDESERT_RULED_CONTENT_1 ==============
       Bible §4: a hollow fractal tube, hand-high, branching into graded
       open-ended pipes. The rising-pitch sound mechanic (ambient sustainer
       keyed to the charge comp's own two-longtick warm countdown) is
       BLUEDESERT_MECHANICS_BUILD_1 §5's — this card ships silent-capable,
       reusing the same CompProperties_PlantCharge every other native flora
       already carries (zero new mechanism class, per the bible). Art:
       Textures/Things/Plant/RM_Virr/RM_Virr_a.png (done, artpipe
       bluedesert_bedazzle_cast.csv) — one variant landed of the three
       commissioned; Graphic_Random still correct with only "_a" present. -->
